>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `LINARITH_ext_ss`

``` hol4
linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss : simpExtLib.ssfrag
linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss_budgeted :
  searchBudget.budget -> simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provides the explicitly tracked linear-arithmetic fragment.

These fragments lift the same ordinary reducer closures used by
`LINARITH_ss` and `LINARITH_ss_budgeted`. They do not duplicate the
context collector, arithmetic caches, or budget state. Choose the
extension fragment before installation into an extension simpset.
Ordinary `LINARITH_ss` and ordinary reducer/destructor clients remain
ordinary.

### Example

``` hol4
val arithmetic_ss = simpExtLib.++
  (simpExtLib.lift_simpset (BasicProvers.srw_ss ()),
   linarithLib.LINARITH_ext_ss);
```

